/T (The objective is to design a digital controller that manages the sequence of railway crossing operations based on train approach, train departure, and gate-position inputs. The controller must generate appropriate gate commands, warning signals, and road traffic signals. It must also detect selected invalid sensor combinations and enter a fault state.)
