/E (After the warning counter reaches its configured threshold, the controller enters the closing state. Once the gate-closed feedback is received, the FSM moves to the train-passage state. After the train-departure input is asserted, the controller enters the opening state. When gate-open feedback is received, the controller returns to IDLE.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (The design also includes a FAULT state for selected invalid input combinations. In the implemented RTL, the FAULT state is retained until reset. The controller requests gate closure and keeps the warning and road-red indications active while in this state.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
